        "topic_name": "The Second Measure: (Al-Wudhu)",
        "text": "Sihr does not affect a person in a state of wudhu', for he is protected by an angel sent by the Merciful (Allah SWT) Ibn 'Abbas (RA) reported: \"The Prophet (∩╖║) said, 'Wash these bodies, and Allah (SWT) will wash you. There is not a servant who sleeps in a state of wudhu, but that an angel accompanies him in his clothes, and there is not a moment that he moves in bed, but that the angel says: 'O Allah! Forgive Your Servant, for he has slept in a clean state.\" [Transmitted by At-Tabarani in Al-Awsat According to Al-Mundirs, the chain of transmission is very good (At-Targhb:2/13)]"
